        RULES {
            #L5RWW90cD0eF2gH4iJ6kL8mN: imbalanced_earth_terrain "Earth: The ground in this area is barren, lifeless, and filled with cracks and fissures. The Earth kami seem to be absent, or at least unresponsive and cannot be called upon. Additionally, when a character performs a check using the Earth ring, the TN is increased by 1. If they fail the check, they lose their stability and become Prone (see page 273 of the core rulebook)."
